OL,3,GNEWSAMetal detecting 'gives your brain
OL,4,Aa break' from screens
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an age dominated by screens, social
OL,7,Fmedia and artificial intelligence (AI),
OL,8,Fmetal detecting enthusiasts say the
OL,9,Fhobby helps them escape the digital
OL,10,Fworld and slow down.
OL,12,FFor cousins Lucilla Gray and Eleanor
OL,13,FBruce, what started as a hobby during
OL,14,Fthe Covid pandemic evolved into a way
OL,15,Fto switch off from modern life's
OL,16,Fconstant distractions.
OL,18,FThe pair, from Lincolnshire, have been
OL,19,Fmetal detecting for six years.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
