OL,3,GNEWSAMetal detecting 'gives your brain
OL,4,Aa break' from screens
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn that time they have uncovered Roman
OL,7,Fbrooch fragments, a Medieval buckle and
OL,8,Fa Victorian needle casing with an
OL,9,Fincredible women's history tied to it.
